Provenance
----------
The 12 operator modules in this repository were written to specifications
provided by the copyright holder, with implementation assistance from Google
Gemini. Adapted copies of some of these modules are maintained in the
hetero-moe research repository
(https://github.com/Microbiosis/hetero-moe) under
research/aligner/v62_dimension_projection_space/ and are distributed under
the same license.

Per-module license headers were deliberately not inserted, so the operator
files stay byte-identical to the original versions; the repository-level
LICENSE file applies to every file here.

smoke_test.py, README.md and .gitignore were written for this repository and
are likewise covered by the LICENSE file.

